# PowKiddy V90 (Allwinner suniv "F1C" family, ARM926EJ-S / armv5te).
#
# DEFINITION ONLY - not built or verified in this repo (see README.md).
# GBA-SP-style clamshell (June 2020) with extra L2/R2 shoulder buttons;
# otherwise the same SoC and boot chain as the rest of the family, with
# the button matrix handled at runtime by the family kernel. Early units
# have a known USB-C charging quirk documented upstream:
# https://github.com/MiyooCFW/docs/blob/master/docs/Fixing-USB-C-charging-on-the-PowKiddy-V90.md
#
# Self-contained (it selects the architecture itself), so
# generate-config.sh --device powkiddy-v90 uses it in place of an arch
# fragment.

include sdk/board/allwinner-suniv/common.config
